B.aro=new A.bR(B.qf,null,B.aU,"Widgets on your home screen","A question that changes every hour, the daily challenge, your streak, your weakest key \u2014 put any of them where you will see them.",!1)
B.arl=new A.bR(null,"\u266f\u266d",B.aw,"Mastery, key by key","Twelve tiles showing where you actually stand, and a shortcut straight into the key you keep getting wrong.",!1)
B.ark=new A.bR(B.hD,null,B.am,"Pocket Mode speaks properly","A real recorded voice instead of a synthetic one, and the keyboard names every note the way your current key spells it.",!1)
